  "question": {
    "text": "A body of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>500</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> moves along <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis such that it&#39;s velocity varies with displacement <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> according to the relation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> the force acting on the body is:",
    "image": null
  },
